| Topic | Remember |
|---|---|
| NAT | Static 1-to-1, dynamic pool, PAT many-to-one by port |
| NAT terms | Inside local = private; inside global = public |
| NTP | UDP 123; stratum 0-15, 16 = unsynchronized |
| DHCP | DORA; UDP 67/68; relay = `ip helper-address` on client side |
| DHCP lease | Renew 50%, rebind 87.5%, default 1 day |
| DNS | UDP 53 queries, TCP 53 zone transfers; A, AAAA, CNAME, MX, PTR |
| SNMP | Ports 161/162; v3 authPriv is the secure choice |
| Syslog | UDP 514; levels 0-7; lower = more severe; default server level 6 |
| QoS | Mark, queue, police (drop), shape (delay) |
| DSCP | EF = 46 (voice); AFxy = 8x + 2y |
| SSH | TCP 22; needs hostname, domain, RSA key, `login local` |
| TFTP / FTP | UDP 69 / TCP 20-21; both insecure; use SCP or SFTP |









